# Activity detail & peek program

**Canonical checklist:** `docs/experiment/activity-detail-tabs-implementation-plan.md` (exit criteria, trace matrix §8).  
**Dynamic CTA product spec (mandatory before peek/detail CTA work):** same doc **§6.2** (states A–E), cross-rules **§6.2.1**, implementation order **§6.7**.
**Tier-1:** `docs/NAVIGATION.md` § Activity detail · `docs/DOMAIN_CANONICALS.md` §15 · `docs/MEMBER_MODEL.md` (Pro vs host).  
**Summary pointer only:** `docs/experiment/member-surfaces-implementation-plan.md` §21 — do not tick AD-4/AD-5 peek parity there without closing tests here.

Also read: `.cursor/rules/viewer-access.mdc` for wire-first exposure rules.

## Definition of done (every PR)

1. Name **requirement IDs** from program doc §8 in the PR / commit message.
2. **Remove list** — delete bypassed paths in the same PR (no second CTA matrix in components).
3. **L1** `packages/shared-types` policy tests for any new behavior row.
4. **Horizontal pass:** API registrar + `src/api/domains/*` + UI + **one** Tier-1 section if product changed.
5. Flip checkboxes **only** in `activity-detail-tabs-implementation-plan.md` when `src/activity/activityDetailAcceptance.test.ts` rows are green (not `it.fails`).
6. `npm run verify:system:quick` minimum; full `verify:system` before closing a **phase**.

## Consumer page architecture (Phase 9)

- **Route:** `ActivityDetail.tsx` → `ActivityDetailByKind` → kind `*ActivityDetailPage` → `ActivityDetailPageShell` → `ActivityDetailView`.
- **Embedded host surfaces** (`ActivityManageSheet`, `ActivityPreviewOverlay`) use **`ActivityDetailView` only** — no kind router.
- **Phase 9** (templates + fold + Plan IA) — see program §8 **AD-TEMPLATE-01**, **AD-FOLD-01**, **AD-BODY-01**.

## Policy architecture

| Layer | Owner |
|-------|--------|
| L1 | `resolveActivityEngagementPolicy` + `projectActivityMapPeekActions` in shared-types |
| L2 | `GET /activities/:id` `presentation` from policy; explore `mapPeekActions` from policy intents |
| L3 | React maps wire ids → buttons; **no** `isHostUser` peek CTA matrices |

## Forbidden without explicit program ID + remove target

- New `showHostActivityCtas` branches for **activity** peek/list.
- Client `computeActivityMapPeekActions` outside `activityPeekEngagement` fallback.
- Marking peek/detail parity complete without matrix tests (**AD-CTA-01** / `activity-detail-cta-matrix.test.ts`).
- Implementing CTAs not listed in §6.2 without updating the program doc first.
- Chrome/copy changes without `activityDetailCopy.ts` + NAVIGATION § Activity detail.

